 "title": "US climate change",
 "hook": "On Friday, the Washington Post released several datasets and computer scripts from its Pulitzer Prize–winning series, “2°C: Beyond the Limit,” which examined how “extreme climate change has arrived in America.” The data files — derived from NOAA’s nClimDiv and nClimGrid climate datasets — contain the annual average temperatures and seasonal temperature changes for each state and county in the contiguous US.",
